OL,3,GNEWSAPair plan 20-mile walk for
OL,4,Alifesaving cause
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Jamie Richards MBE helped install
OL,7,Fa defibrillator on his town's high
OL,8,Fstreet 12 years ago, it marked the
OL,9,Fbeginning of a much bigger project.
OL,11,FMore than 50 of the potentially
OL,12,Flifesaving devices are now available
OL,13,Facross Stone, Staffordshire, while the
OL,14,Fcharity he founded, AED Donate, has
OL,15,Fhelped install 10,000 across the
OL,16,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
