OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F358A1791354351
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPair plan 20-mile walk for
OL,4,Alifesaving cause
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichards and fellow resident Joe Dean
OL,7,Fare preparing to embark on a 20-mile
OL,8,Fcharity walk around the town in a bid
OL,9,Fto raise #2,500 to keep the
OL,10,Fdefibrillators maintained and ready for
OL,11,Fuse for another year.
OL,13,F"We just wanted a bit of a different
OL,14,Fway, really, to enable us to fund these
OL,15,Fdefibrillators, and that's where Joe
OL,16,Fand I came up with a plan to do our
OL,17,Fwalk," he said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
